OL,3,ATrump to host Xi for state dinner as
OL,4,Atech bosses and other guests arrive at
OL,5,AWhite House
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump and First Lady Melania are
OL,8,Fabout to welcome Xi Jinping and his
OL,9,Fwife back to the White House, where the
OL,10,Fleaders will deliver remarks and attend
OL,11,Fa state dinner - check out the menu
OL,13,FWho has a seat at the table? Big tech
OL,14,Fbosses are on the list, including
OL,15,FTesla's Elon Musk, Apple's Tim Cook,
OL,16,FOpenAI's Sam Altman and Nvidia's Jensen
OL,17,FHuang - watch live above
